  "body": "## Changelog\n### Features\n* b0116fdcb1c29600b1f9bba5119e5db161ce124c feat: harden wiki preservation, skills, search and web workspace\n### Documentation\n* 537121ddcc3c75e39a4e7ddce9231d78831d486c docs: preserve full audit and adversarial adjudication\n\n## Install\n\nFull build (semantic search) via Homebrew:\n\n    brew install neutrospec/tap/canopy\n    canopy model pull   # one-time ~2.3GB bge-m3 download\n\nThe attached `*_lite` archives are keyword-search-only (no dependencies).\n\n"
